  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting a localised humanitarian response to build resilience in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the British Red Cross (BRC) support the Ukrainian Red Cross Society (URCS) One Plan 2023-2025 focusing on humanitarian action, resilience and recovery  in Ukraine as well as supporting a strong national society. The one plan will also support the strengthening URCS&#x2019;s role as a leading auxiliary partner in addressing humanitarian crises and recovery in Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
